# Seolleyeon recommendation pipeline Docker build context filter
# Build context = project root,  Dockerfile = recsys/Dockerfile

# Exclude everything first
*

# Include pipeline code
!recsys
!recsys/**
!lib
!lib/ai_recommend_model
!lib/ai_recommend_model/*.py

# Include avatar worker build inputs when using cloudbuild.avatar-worker.yaml.
!requirements_avatar_worker.txt
!lib/ai_recommend_model/avatar_generation
!lib/ai_recommend_model/avatar_generation/**
